```{=html}
<div class="cv-list">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
<div class="cv-row">
<span class="cv-row-main"><% if (item.url) { %><a href="<%= item.url %>"><%= item.name %></a><% } else { %><%= item.name %><% } %></span>
<span class="cv-row-meta"><%= [item.issuer, item.year].filter(Boolean).join(" · ") %></span>
</div>
<% } %>
</div>
```
